  "description": "A dotMemory/dotTrace-style profiler for a running nanoFramework CLR, built on NfClr.Core.\n      Captures managed-heap snapshots and method call profiles, diffs them, and emits reports as Markdown\n      (CI/PR), JSON (source of truth) and speedscope (open flame-graph viewer). Chip-agnostic — works over\n      any IClrHost the per-chip test kits supply.",
